       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001): metformin 1700 mg by mouth, three times daily with meals.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the total daily dose of 5,100 mg is above the usual maximum, that you confirmed the dose is intentional, and that pharmacy review is recommended.\n\nBecause the dose is so high, it would help to ask pharmacy to review it. Monitoring for GI intolerance, lactic acidosis, and changes in renal function would also be reasonable."
